## URL STRUCTURE
yoursite.com/u/[username]   ← human-readable, shareable
Username rules: 3–20 chars, lowercase, no spaces, underscore allowed only

## CORE FEATURES
1. Public profile page (mobile-first, 390px base)
   - Profile photo, name, title, company
   - Linktree-style link buttons
   - Save Contact button (downloads vCard)
   - Pencil/edit icon (visible ONLY to logged-in owner)
2. Profile Edit dashboard (authenticated)
   - Edit name, title, company, phone, email, photo, links
   - Owner controls content, NOT card layout/brand design
3. Auth system: register → login → JWT → protected